{
    "title": "RRH MyCare",
    "description": "As a Rochester Regional Health patient, you can securely manage and receive information about your medical record. MyCare provides you with secure access to health information anywhere, at any time. It\u2019s a health management tool that can improve communication with your providers, document important health care information, and ultimately give you the ability to make more informed decisions so that every next day is the healthiest it can be.\r\n \r\nWith MyCare, you can access your lab and test results, request prescription renewals, schedule appointments, communicate with your providers, and pay your bills. MyCare offers personalized and secure online access to portions of your medical records 24/7. \r\n \r\nIf you already have a Rochester Regional Health MyCare account, you are ready to begin.\r\n \r\nIf you do not have a Rochester Regional Health MyCare account, create one by clicking Sign Up Now in the app or by visiting https://mycare.rochesterregional.org\r\n\r\nFor assistance email MyCare@RochesterRegional.org or call (585) 922-1234",
    "descriptionHTML": "As a Rochester Regional Health patient, you can securely manage and receive information about your medical record. MyCare provides you with secure access to health information anywhere, at any time. It\u2019s a health management tool that can improve communication with your providers, document important health care information, and ultimately give you the ability to make more informed decisions so that every next day is the healthiest it can be.<br> <br>With MyCare, you can access your lab and test results, request prescription renewals, schedule appointments, communicate with your providers, and pay your bills. MyCare offers personalized and secure online access to portions of your medical records 24/7. <br> <br>If you already have a Rochester Regional Health MyCare account, you are ready to begin.<br> <br>If you do not have a Rochester Regional Health MyCare account, create one by clicking Sign Up Now in the app or by visiting https://mycare.rochesterregional.org<br><br>For assistance email MyCare@RochesterRegional.org or call (585) 922-1234",
